scn 1
# Strait: 3x3 boats, fleet of 48 (all cross on main, slowly).
# Fleet of 48 boats of footprint 3 crosses the archipelago: round the island and its shelf, then through
# the 10-cell strait (x 116-123, z 47-56) in a land barrier, to a point east of it. Map and fleet from
# legion_world_test navalisland (the archipelago heights are reduced to the ascii classes:
# '~' deep sea, ',' a shelf too shallow for a 13-deep keel, '.' land; the island's jagged cliffs and the
# south beach's ramp are flat land here, which boats cannot tell apart).
# Control: crosses on main.
# Speed 1.79999 is the world test's raw 117964. Observe: region.east.inside (boats east of x=124), arrived,
# gate.strait.*, reversals, stopped_permille.
name strait-3x48
ticks 9000
seed 7
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
map ascii
